ndar'=>'approximate; check the official calendar','Last year: %1$s payments, %2$s, %3$s new donors.'=>'Last year: %1$s payments, %2$s, %3$s new donors.','Ad spend %1$s (ROAS %2$s).'=>'Ad spend %1$s (ROAS %2$s).','No payments in this period last year.'=>'No payments in this period last year.','Delete this date?'=>'Delete this date?','Add your own date'=>'Add your own date','A campaign day of your own: an anniversary, an event, a planting day.'=>'A campaign day of your own: an anniversary, an event, a planting day.','Name'=>'Name','Prepare days before'=>'Prepare days before','Start'=>'Start','End'=>'End','Add'=>'Add','Find out what really works. A/B: two ads in the same campaign, compared by donations per click on this site. Holdout: a fixed share of an audience does not see the ads; comparing the two groups shows how many donations the ads really added.'=>'Find out what really works. A/B: two ads in the same campaign, compared by donations per click on this site. Holdout: a fixed share of an audience does not see the ads; comparing the two groups shows how many donations the ads really added.','No tests yet.'=>'No tests yet.','Running'=>'Running','Ended'=>'Ended','open-ended'=>'open-ended','Audience "%1$s", %2$s%% held out'=>'Audience "%1$s", %2$s%% held out','Pause "%s"'=>'Pause "%s"','End the test? The held-out people go back into the Meta audience.'=>'End the test? The held-out people go back into the Meta audience.','End the test? The result is kept.'=>'End the test? The result is kept.','End test'=>'End test','Delete this test and its result?'=>'Delete this test and its result?','New A/B test'=>'New A/B test','No active campaign with ads. Create two variants in Studio first.'=>'No active campaign with ads. Create two variants in Studio first.','Pick two ads of the same campaign. Studio drafts already tag each variant (utm_content), so donations are counted per ad.'=>'Pick two ads of the same campaign. Studio drafts already tag each variant (utm_content), so dona