es your ad account only when you approve it: an audience, a pause or budget change, or a Studio draft (always created paused).'=>'Business Settings › Users › System users › add the ad account › Generate token. ads_read is enough for spend; audiences, Campaigns changes and Studio drafts need ads_management. Empty = the Conversions API token is tried. Flux Ads changes your ad account only when you approve it: an audience, a pause or budget change, or a Studio draft (always created paused).','Pixel ID'=>'Pixel ID','TikTok Ads Manager › Tools › Events › Web events.'=>'TikTok Ads Manager › Tools › Events › Web events.','Events API access token'=>'Events API access token','Pixel › Settings › Events API › Generate access token.'=>'Pixel › Settings › Events API › Generate access token.','While testing only.'=>'While testing only.','Measurement ID'=>'Measurement ID','Empty = the theme\'s ID (%s). The theme already loads the tag; Flux Ads only adds the donation events.'=>'Empty = the theme\'s ID (%s). The theme already loads the tag; Flux Ads only adds the donation events.','Admin › Data streams › Measurement ID.'=>'Admin › Data streams › Measurement ID.','Measurement Protocol API secret'=>'Measurement Protocol API secret','Data stream › Measurement Protocol API secrets › Create. Needed for bank-transfer donations approved later. To see donations in Google Ads, import the GA4 "purchase" conversion there.'=>'Data stream › Measurement Protocol API secrets › Create. Needed for bank-transfer donations approved later. To see donations in Google Ads, import the GA4 "purchase" conversion there.','Target ROAS'=>'Target ROAS','Income on the site per 1 spent on ads. Under half of it: lower the budget; 1.5 times and more: raise it.'=>'Income on the site per 1 spent on ads. Under half of it: lower the budget; 1.5 times and more: raise it.','Spend before judging (7 days)'=>'Spend before judging (7 days)','In the ad account currency. 0 = automatic: twice your average cost per payment.'=>'In the ad account currency. 0 = automatic: twice your average cost per payment.','Privacy'=>'Privacy','Wait for consent (recommended): pixels and the ad cookie start only after the visitor accepts the theme cookie banner. Donations of visitors who did not accept are counted in the report but not sent to ad platforms.'=>'Wait for consent (recommended): pixels and the ad cookie start only after the visitor accepts the theme cookie banner. Donations of visitors who did not accept are counted in the report but not sent to ad platforms.','Always: you collect consent another way.'=>'Always: you collect consent another way.','E-mail and phone (for better matching)'=>'E-mail and phone (for better matching)','Only for contacts with ad consent in Flux CRM (recommended). Sent as SHA-256 hashes, never in plain text.'=>'Only for contacts with ad consent in Flux CRM (recommended). Sent as SHA-256 hashes, never in plain text.','Never: only the browser ID, IP and browser type.'=>'Never: only the browser ID, IP and browser type.','Always (hashed). Your privacy notice must say so.'=>'Always (hashed). Your privacy notice must say so.','Load the browser pixels too (page views, form and checkout steps). Off = server events only.'=>'Load the browser pixels too (page views, form and checkout steps). Off = server events only.','Attribution window (days)'=>'Attribution window (days)','How long a click counts for a later donation.'=>'How long a click counts for a later donation.','Save settings'=>'Save settings'));
